#: layouts/404.html:13
msgid ""
"If you typed the page address in the Address bar, make sure that it is "
"spelled correctly."
msgstr ""
"Jika anda menaip alamat halaman di dalam palang Alamat, pastikan ia dieja "
"dengan betul."

#: layouts/404.html:6
