#: layouts/projects/list.html:36
msgid "Session Manager"
msgstr "Pengurus Sesi"

#: layouts/projects/list.html:38
msgid ""
"The session manager controls all aspects of the startup and the shutdown of "
"the user session."
msgstr ""
"Pengurus sesi mengawal semua aspek permulaan dan penutupan sesi pengguna."

#: layouts/projects/list.html:44
msgid "Settings Manager"
msgstr "Pengurus Tetapan"

#: layouts/projects/list.html:46
msgid "It allows you to configure every detail of your desktop environment."
msgstr ""
"Ia membolehkan anda konfigur setiap perincian persekitaran desktop anda."

#: layouts/projects/list.html:98
msgid "Terminal"
msgstr "Terminal"

#: layouts/projects/list.html:100
msgid ""
"Terminal is a modern terminal emulator featuring tabs and transparent "
"backgrounds."
msgstr ""
"Terminal adalah emulator terminal modern yang fiturkan tab dan latar "
"belakang lutsinar."

#: layouts/projects/list.html:52
msgid "Thunar File Manager"
msgstr "Pengurus Fail Thunar"

#: layouts/projects/list.html:54
msgid ""
"Thunar is a modern file manager designed from the ground up to be fast and "
"easy-to-use."
msgstr ""

#: layouts/projects/list.html:106
msgid "Xfburn"
msgstr "Xfburn"

#: layouts/projects/list.html:108
msgid "Xfburn is an application to create and burn CD's and DVD's."
msgstr "Xfburn adalah aplikasi yang dapat mencipta dan merakam CD dan DVD."

#: layouts/projects/list.html:86
msgid "Simple client-server configuration storage and query system."
msgstr "Storan konfigurasi klien-pelayan dan sistem pertanyaan ringkas."

#: layouts/projects/list.html:28
msgid "Desktop Manager"
msgstr "Pengurus Desktop"

#: layouts/projects/list.html:30
msgid ""
"This program sets the background image and provides a root window menu, "
"desktop icons or minimized icons and a windows list."
msgstr ""
"Program ini tetapkan imej latar belakang dan menyediakan menu tetingkap "
"root, ikon desktop atau ikon diminimum dan senarai tetingkap."

#: layouts/projects/list.html:12
msgid "Window Manager"
msgstr "Pengurus Tetingkap"

#: layouts/projects/list.html:14
msgid ""
"It manages the placement of application windows on the screen, provides "
"window decorations and manages workspaces or virtual desktops."
msgstr ""
"Ia mengurus kedudukan tetingkap aplikasi pada skrin, menyediakan hiasan "
"tetingkap dan mengurus ruang kerja atau desktop maya."

